@host = http://localhost:5300
@apiKey = dev-api-key-not-a-secret

### Assistant chat -> streams SSE (text, tool_call, tool_result, done); model may create a ticket
POST {{host}}/api/v1/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "messages": [
        { "role": "User", "content": "Der Drucker im 3. Stock reagiert seit heute Morgen nicht mehr, mehrere Kollegen sind betroffen. Bitte bis Freitag 9 Uhr beheben." }
    ]
}

### Assistant chat -> vague time, model should ask a clarifying question instead of guessing
POST {{host}}/api/v1/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "messages": [
        { "role": "User", "content": "Das WLAN im Meetingraum ist instabil. Bis Freitag morgens muss es erledigt sein." }
    ]
}

### Assistant chat -> multi-turn: model updates the ticket it created (replace ticket id from previous response)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "messages": [
        { "role": "User", "content": "Der Drucker im 3. Stock reagiert nicht mehr. Bitte bis Freitag 9 Uhr beheben." },
        { "role": "Assistant", "content": "Ticket erstellt: 3rd floor printer unresponsive, Priorität High, fällig Freitag 09:00. Ticket-ID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000" },
        { "role": "User", "content": "Bitte ändere die Priorität auf Critical und die Frist auf Donnerstag 17 Uhr." }
    ]
}

### Assistant chat -> empty messages, should be 400 ProblemDetails
POST {{host}}/api/v1/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "messages": []
}

### Update ticket directly (replace id) -> partial update via PATCH
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/tickets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "priority": "Critical",
    "dueAt": "2026-07-03T17:00:00+02:00"
}

### Verify: list tickets (assistant-created tickets appear, actor 'ai-assistant' in audit)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tickets?page=1&pageSize=20
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
